node_modules
.env
/generated/prisma

# prisma/migrations/ was ignored here in June. It has to be tracked: the
# migration files *are* the schema's history, and a deploy that cannot see them
# cannot apply anything. Ignoring them is what forced the Dockerfile onto
# `db push`, which eventually tried to delete a trip's worth of data — see the
# comment there. Eighteen of the thirty migrations on disk had never been
# committed by the time it fired.
